<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The Statement of Consolidated unaudited financial results comprises of the financial resutls of Chemfab Alkalis Limited (CAL) ( the Parent Company ) and Chemfab Alkalis Karaikal Limited (CAKL) ( the Subsidiary ) (together referred to as  the Group ). These financial resutls were reciewed and recommended by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors of the Parent Company at thier meeting held on 08 August 2024.       2. During the current quarter ended 30th June 2024, the Parent Company had allotted 50,000 Equity Shares of Rs 10 each upon exercise of Employee stock options by the eligible employees under Employee's Stock Option Scheme  CAESOS 2020 .      Consequently, the paid up share capital of the Parent Company had increased from Rs. 1,433.66 Lakhs to Rs. 1,427.66 Lakhs during the period ended 30 June 2024.       3. The Group has indentified its reportable segments in accordance with Ind AS 108 - Operating Segments. Accordlingly, two reportable segnment i.e. Chemicals and Related Products and PVC - O pipes have been indentified, the details of which are given below:      4. The figures for the quarter ended 31March 2024 are the balancing figures between audited figures of the fully financial year ended 31 March 2024 and publised year to date figure upto third quarter ended 31 December 2023.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
